  "preference": "B",
  "rationale": "The user did not say what product or budget they have. B handles this missing information better: it lays out options for several business types and budget levels, then asks for the product direction and budget range so it can give a tailored plan. It is also far more specific and actionable, naming platforms (Meesho, Razorpay, WhatsApp Business) and giving costs, pricing anchors, budget-tiered plans and India-specific risks such as app bans, returns and payment delays. B has flaws: it makes an odd claim about running a search, assumes an AI Agent product, and some figures may be imprecise. A, by contrast, is generic consulting boilerplate that could apply to any country, offers little India-specific detail, and never asks for the missing information."
